WEBVTT

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:17.800
Welcome, sir.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.800
Welcome to Konohanatei.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.610
Allow me to carry your luggage...

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:23.690
Um...

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:26.020
Sir?

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:27.450
It's fine, Yuzu.

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:31.670
That man is Sakura's regular.

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:22.030
<b>Konohana Kitan</b>

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:27.040
<b>Episode 11: 
A God's Day Off</b>

00:02:33.140 --> 00:02:36.080
Are you sure I shouldn't 
serve him tea or anything?

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:38.910
It's fine. Leave them to it.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:11.620
He's here to enjoy his time with Sakura.

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:14.670
So it's the kind of hospitality 
only Sakura-chan can provide.

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:20.900
Oh, speaking of which, 
Ren's regulars are also coming today.

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:22.760
You should greet them, too.

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:24.010
Okay.

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:27.400
<i>Ren-chan's regulars...</i>

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:30.390
Your hair smells nice, Onee-sama.

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:31.410
You can tell?

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:33.060
It's my new perfume.

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:35.330
<i>Something like that?</i>

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:40.360
Oh, my! Are you the new face here?

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:43.900
She looks so dull.

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:45.820
You make me want to polish you up.

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:50.670
Please don't tease the new girl too much.

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:53.850
Oh? We aren't teasing her.

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:55.170
Right?

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:57.330
We're just adoring her.

00:03:57.850 --> 00:04:00.460
They're gods of entertainment.

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:03.070
Aren't their clothes and makeup fabulous?

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:06.000
You both look great, as always.

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:06.000
Y-Yes...

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:10.340
We were supposed to have 
another one with us today.

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:14.560
But she ditched us, saying 
she's going to a local festival.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:19.220
It must be so nice being 
a god in a devout town.

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:23.950
Nobody shows up for us
except on New Year's.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:27.840
Now, people only call on the 
gods when they need help.

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:29.150
Oh, dear.

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:32.940
There used to be festivals all the time.

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:35.630
All sorts of gods got invited 
to the mortal world.

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:38.240
Right, right. That's so true.

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:42.760
You know how this place is in the path 
between heaven and the mortal world?

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:47.830
Konohanatei was bustling back then.

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:51.630
Why did they stop doing as many 
festivals in the mortal world?

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:55.180
Yeah, why is it, Onee-sama?

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:57.830
I would have no idea.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:01.650
Foreign festivals seem to be all the rage.

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:06.380
Like the dress-up parade 
that's popular these days.

00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:10.110
I bet you wouldn't even have to dress up.

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:12.070
Look who's talking!

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.370
Long time no see, sisters.

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:19.800
My, what brings you here today?

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:20.840
How have you been?

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:21.790
You're all spruced up!

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:24.020
Beautiful!

00:05:22.530 --> 00:05:25.620
Let's have a festival, just the three of us.

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:27.220
Festival! Festival!

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:30.840
Please, sisters, don't forget about me!

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:34.720
Are they gone?

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:37.930
Natsume-chan? Why are you hiding?

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:42.530
They lick me all over 
whenever they find me.

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:45.240
Anyway, have you seen Sakura?

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:47.940
She ditched work and vanished somewhere.

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:53.190
Sakura-chan is serving her 
regular guest in the garden.

00:05:53.190 --> 00:05:54.750
The master's here?!

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:55.580
Yay!

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:58.200
I'm going to ask him to teach me kendo later!

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:02.240
Is that guest a kendo master?

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:03.920
Nah.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.870
He's a god of battle.

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:10.390
Of course, since there haven't 
been many wars in the mortal world,

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:11.510
he has a lot of spare time.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.800
There used to be festivals all the time.

00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:23.160
All sorts of gods got invited 
to the mortal world.

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:27.020
Now, people only call on the 
gods when they need help.

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:53.230
I'll bring a hatchet and a 
small knife right away, sir.

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:57.320
You'll damage your precious sword.

00:06:56.510 --> 00:06:58.310
I don't mind.

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:04.570
If I don't use it, it's only going to rust.

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:13.240
It can't ever fly if it's a katana.

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:40.450
How fantastic!

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:41.060
This is great!

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:46.820
Natsume, you need to dance.

00:07:51.810 --> 00:07:54.570
Or else I'll lick you.

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:58.740
F-Fine, I'll do the loach-scooping dance.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:07:59.990
Can you handle these, too?

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:08.880
Seeing this...

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:15.430
makes me feel like I'm back
at the old Konohanatei.

00:08:19.110 --> 00:08:22.270
You're the guest who came after they did.

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:33.690
Did Konohanatei always 
party like this in the past?

00:08:34.390 --> 00:08:35.260
Yeah.

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:40.140
The mortal world used to be 
lively back then, too.

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:45.900
There were a lot of wars, but the gods 
would visit far more than they do now.

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:49.300
Konohanatei was booming.

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:51.800
It was a great time.

00:08:55.720 --> 00:09:00.390
I don't know how Konohanatei 
was back then, but I think...

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:06.140
there are some kinds of 
hospitality that we can only offer

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:07.940
because it's the way it is now.

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:14.010
You've gotten pretty wise, stray fox.

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:17.570
If that's what you think, 
you'd best get a move on.

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:18.990
R-Right!

00:09:27.140 --> 00:09:28.920
What is that?

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.800
Put your back into it!

00:09:31.280 --> 00:09:33.050
Wow.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:35.790
We've opened three barrels 
just for that table.

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:38.390
Hey, who's that lady there?

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:41.480
I haven't seen her before.

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:44.310
Isn't she the gods' companion?

00:09:44.590 --> 00:09:47.290
Yo, we're out of sake!

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:48.620
Yuzu-chan, can you take it?

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:50.590
Okay, right away!

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:59.430
Thank you.

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:02.150
We look forward to seeing you again.

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:11.110
You don't need to see them off.

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:13.120
Go ahead and get some rest, please.

00:10:13.560 --> 00:10:16.230
It looks like you were drinking until dawn.

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:18.240
I suppose.

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:21.340
I can't say no when they invite me to join.

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:24.080
Who is she?

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:26.020
She wasn't a guest?

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:28.470
Her voice sounds familiar, though.

00:10:28.930 --> 00:10:30.690
What's the matter, kids?

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:32.820
You're creeping me out, 
staring at me like that.

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:37.640
Well, the girls haven't seen 
you like this before, Okami.

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:38.950
Okami?!

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:40.110
You're kidding!

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:43.790
Are you that surprised 
to see me in makeup?

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:45.950
This goes beyond fraud!

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:48.290
Okami, where do you buy your makeup?

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:05.480
What?

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:08.220
You want to watch me put on makeup?

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:12.450
You girls ask for such strange things.

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:17.690
First, I put on powder.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:21.570
Next...

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:25.080
Wait! I blinked and missed that!

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:27.710
Me, too! What is that powder?!

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:36.700
I'm so bored.

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:41.280
I'm bored out of my mind.

00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:44.260
I think I'll play with them.

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:49.720
We're going to have gods again today.

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:51.340
And it's going to be a group.

00:11:51.340 --> 00:11:53.230
A group?

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:55.940
We're having gods over again?

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:59.060
The gods are busy around the new year.

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:01.310
They get some rest ahead of time.

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:05.870
Kiri's asked me to assign work.

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:08.070
It'll be pretty busy, just so you know.

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:09.610
Okay.

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:11.220
Let's work hard.

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:16.600
What's wrong, Okiku-chan?

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:19.630
I-It's nothing.

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:23.640
Also, I don't know why you've 
started calling me Okiku,

00:12:23.640 --> 00:12:26.620
but my name isn't Okiku!

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:35.410
I think I'll go out to town.

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:38.860
They told me not to go too far,

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:42.900
but it can't hurt if it's just a little, right?

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:46.330
You agree with me, huh?

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:50.340
All right, it's settled!

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:57.940
What does it matter if I'm there or not?

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:03.170
It's not like anyone cares.

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:12.600
It's the year-end rush.

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:13.800
Move it!

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:16.510
Get out of the way or you'll get hurt!

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:18.680
Move it!

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:25.140
What is it, Urinosuke?

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:44.410
Come on, wake up.

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:47.900
You can move, can't you?

00:13:50.130 --> 00:13:51.310
Where am I?

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:52.830
Konohanatei.

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:58.490
You were thrown out with trash, 
so I brought you home.

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:01.090
I see.

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:03.870
I was thrown out.

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:05.200
That's right!

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:09.830
So from now on, 
you're going to be my doll.

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:13.200
First, we need to do something 
about your dirty clothes.

00:14:15.310 --> 00:14:17.480
Just leave it to me.

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:21.040
One of the foxes here is good at fixing things.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.750
Another is good at sewing.

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:25.100
And one does anything you ask.

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:28.260
They're all basically my servants.

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:31.000
Ren!

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:32.700
What?

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:35.000
I'm busy with a banquet right now.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:37.720
Can you make me some 
new clothes really quick?

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:40.190
Not right now.

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:43.100
I can help if you're busy.

00:14:43.100 --> 00:14:44.470
No need.

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:47.840
We have some important guests today.

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:50.370
You and Sakura-chan have to stay quiet.

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:52.360
That's the best way for you to help.

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:55.020
Forget it!

00:14:55.230 --> 00:15:00.990
W-Well, you know, we need 
to get your body fixed up first.

00:15:02.280 --> 00:15:04.590
You're full of cracks.

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:07.280
We need to do something 
about it, or you could get hurt.

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:09.880
There you are.

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:11.140
Natsume, hey—

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:15.810
Hey, Okiku-chan.

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:16.930
Are you all right?

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:19.580
My name isn't Okiku!

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:22.250
And of course I'm not okay!

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:23.910
My head fell off!

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:26.100
That's no good.

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:28.230
There we go.

00:15:29.680 --> 00:15:31.850
First-aid for now.

00:15:31.850 --> 00:15:34.220
Don't put me back together with rice!

00:15:34.710 --> 00:15:36.890
Sorry, but I'm busy right now.

00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:38.910
I'll fix you up properly later!

00:15:39.350 --> 00:15:41.940
Damn it, everyone's getting on my nerves.

00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:43.500
Won't this just fall off?

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:46.450
What's the matter, Okiku-chan?

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:50.580
Oh? Is that lady there your friend?

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:51.820
Yuzu...

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:53.750
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:56.140
<i>This girl's not too useful.</i>

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:57.830
<i>This clumsy fox...</i>

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:04.880
Yuzu, you have work.

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:05.610
Yes?

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:08.470
Get us out of here before Sakura finds us.

00:16:08.470 --> 00:16:10.190
O-Okay.

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:16.380
H-How are you doing, Sakura-chan?

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:34.870
You're so useless!

00:16:47.370 --> 00:16:49.370
We lost them.

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:51.520
Why are we running?

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:55.240
That girl is an enemy to dollkind.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:58.990
Didn't she just want to play with us?

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:00.320
Don't be naïve.

00:17:00.320 --> 00:17:02.950
What she does isn't play. She <i>violates</i> us!

00:17:03.490 --> 00:17:06.710
Ever since, I get light-headed 
whenever I see a pair of scissors.

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:11.630
But that's what we dolls are made for.

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:16.800
That's how you've been 
treated until now, isn't it?

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:18.230
It's all right now.

00:17:18.230 --> 00:17:21.170
The foxes here are all good people.

00:17:21.170 --> 00:17:22.560
Except Sakura.

00:17:23.030 --> 00:17:28.140
You can begin your new life,
your new doll life, here.

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:33.000
From now on, you can curse the 
humans to your heart's content.

00:17:34.810 --> 00:17:37.480
You hate humans?

00:17:37.730 --> 00:17:39.910
Of course I do!

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:42.660
They had me custom-made by an artisan,

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:46.040
and then they left me for 
that mass-produced thing!

00:17:46.950 --> 00:17:52.370
I put a curse on that wretched doll so that 
it loses just one of its shoes and socks.

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:55.040
You hid them, didn't you?

00:17:55.560 --> 00:17:56.960
I'll curse them!

00:17:56.960 --> 00:18:01.430
I'll put a curse on them so they 
get leg cramps every night!

00:18:02.130 --> 00:18:06.020
You've never been played with, have you?

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:11.050
That's why you're so pretty.

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:13.640
You were never handled by a child.

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:16.770
See?

00:18:16.770 --> 00:18:19.240
My body's all scratched up.

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:22.430
It's sunburnt, and the paint's chipped off.

00:18:22.750 --> 00:18:23.490
But...

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:39.290
Each of these scratches is 
a memory I share with her.

00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:46.780
But she threw you out.

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:59.210
That's what happens at the end of our lives.

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:06.960
Girls discover something 
more fun than playing house.

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:09.820
They find someone they like
more than their dolls.

00:19:09.820 --> 00:19:11.320
They grow up.

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:16.550
We're all born to be a girl's friend,

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:20.050
so that's the end of our life.

00:19:23.650 --> 00:19:25.820
I need to go back now.

00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:27.980
Go back where?

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:30.170
You can stay here.

00:19:30.170 --> 00:19:32.220
You're free now.

00:19:32.220 --> 00:19:33.930
Stay here with me.

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:39.580
I'm sorry I can't be your friend.

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:11.700
No wonder it's so cold.

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:14.270
Winter's finally coming.

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:18.960
Why are you sulking?

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:20.700
I'm not sulking.

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:24.080
Are you still angry that 
I brushed you aside earlier?

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:26.930
It's nothing like that.

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:30.160
Jeez... Here.

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:33.260
That's your furisode.

00:20:33.260 --> 00:20:34.560
For New Year's.

00:20:35.340 --> 00:20:39.900
I told you I couldn't make new clothes 
because I was working on that.

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:41.280
Got it?

00:20:45.030 --> 00:20:48.930
You've never been played with, have you?

00:20:55.110 --> 00:20:58.440
Come on, Okiku, why are you crying? Jeez.

00:20:59.670 --> 00:21:03.400
My name isn't Okiku...

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:04.670
Fine, fine.

00:21:06.180 --> 00:21:08.390
But thank you...

00:21:17.990 --> 00:21:19.380
When did you throw it out?

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:20.900
I don't know.

00:21:20.900 --> 00:21:23.580
My mom put it in the trash 
without even asking me.

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:26.470
Find it?

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:31.160
I found her! Lily!

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:35.230
Thank goodness she's still here.

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:38.370
That's a pretty old doll.

00:21:38.370 --> 00:21:39.320
Yeah.

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:43.400
I got her as a Christmas 
present when I was a kid.

00:21:48.720 --> 00:21:51.330
Hey, so where are we taking her?

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:53.870
I made her lonely.

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:57.530
I'm going to buy her new 
clothes to make up for it.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:21:59.200
Say what?

00:21:59.200 --> 00:22:00.600
What's wrong with that?

00:22:00.950 --> 00:22:02.680
She's my best friend.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>Next Episode: 
Miracle on New Year's Eve</b>
